            <ArticleTitle>A case of syphilitic osteitis in a patient with HIV infection.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>765-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1177/0956462414522031</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Osteitis is an under-recognised clinical manifestation of early syphilis, especially in patients with HIV. We report here a case of syphilitic osteitis of the skull and review its clinical presentation, diagnosis and management.</AbstractText>
                <CopyrightInformation>© The Author(s) 2014 Reprints and permissions: sagepub.co.uk/journalsPermissions.nav.</CopyrightInformation>
            </Abstract>
